From 466d145889935ba57d54745174b20655e3a31b89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CVM DPDK prototype <cvm@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 04:03:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] app/testpmd: add synchronous private mbuf bridge for CVM

Keep NIC-facing packet buffers in cvm_shared memory while forwarding engines operate only on synchronous deep copies in private guest memory. Mark the private peer pool non-I/O so device drivers do not register it for DMA, validate RX chains before copying, sanitize device metadata, and preserve pinned external-buffer ownership on TX.
---
